      "message": "test: gate-map headers name the crates moved modules live in\n\nEight suites in crates/app/tests still named post, machining2d, drilling\nand tools as app::<module>, which the no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app\nlaw rejects. The headers now name the owning crate: camcraft_post::post,\ncamcraft_motion::machining2d, camcraft_motion::drilling and\ncamcraft_tools::tools. Comment-only; quick selection for changes in those\ncrates now matches these suites by their real owner.\n\nFixes #1417\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
